      "type": "code",
      "text": "M = [int(x) for x in open('17.txt')]\nA = [x for x in M if str(x)[-2:] == '19']\n\ncount = 0\nmaxi = 0\nfor i in range(0, len(M)-2):\n    x, y, z = M[i], M[i+1], M[i+2]\n    if sum([len(str(abs(j))) == 4 for j in [x, y, z]]) == 2:\n        if sum([abs(j) % 3 == 0 for j in [x, y, z]]) >= 1:\n            if sum([x, y, z]) > max(A):\n                count += 1\n                maxi = max(maxi, x + y + z)\nprint(count, maxi)"
    }
